  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule,\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f22f57d0cf5c493280a0ab6b7dbaea9e3fc5b035c6d410d59c2f476043bd03a8.png] \n\nGiven equation : 25 * 2 * 220 * 11 * 43\n\n1) Using the combination : +, –, ×, =\n\n25 + 2 – **220 × 11 **= 43\n\n**25 + 2 **- 2420 = 43\n\n27 - 2420 = 43\n\n2393 ≠ 43 \n\n2) Using the combination : +, –, ÷, =\n\n25 + 2 – **220 ÷ 11 **= 43\n\n**25 + 2 **- 20 = 43\n\n**27 - 20** = 43\n\n7 ≠ 43 \n\n3) Using the combination : +, +, ÷, =\n\n25 + 2 + **220 ÷ 11** = 43\n\n**25 + 2 + 20** =43\n\n47 ≠ 43 \n\n**4) Using the combination : –, +, ÷, =**\n\n25 – 2 + **220 ÷ 11 **= 43\n\n**25 **- 2 **+ 20 **= 43\n\n45 - 2 = 43\n\n**43 = 43**\n\nHence, the** correct answer** is **\"Option 4\".**",
